&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:27pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:27pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（当事業年度において株式数が増加した銘柄）&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:25pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:442.5pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:114.2pt;min-width:114.2pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:49.7pt;min-width:49.7pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:109.8pt;min-width:109.8pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:168.8pt;min-width:168.8pt;"/&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
